msgid "Mimrec data definitions and analysis"
msgstr "Mimrec 数据定义与分析"

msgid ""
"Define one analysis by its experiment root, exact primary input, prepared external components, "
"main native configuration and baseline overrides. Native operations consume this definition and "
"produce separately recorded results. MEGAlibRuntime controls process startup only; it does not "
"own data or cfg settings."
msgstr "一个分析由实验根、精确主输入、准备好的外部成分、原生主配置和基准覆盖共同定义。原生操作消费该定义，分别产生执行记录。MEGAlibRuntime 仅控制进程启动，不持有数据或 cfg 设置。"

msgid "Bind data and the main configuration once"
msgstr "一次绑定数据和主配置"

msgid ""
"Construction reads metadata and main cfg bytes but creates no directories and starts no native "
"process. working_space is the experiment root directory containing manifest.json and sibling "
"cosima/revan/mimrec directories; never pass an analysis or product subdirectory. analysis_id "
"names this Mimrec group and may differ from the Revan parent. If omitted, it defaults to "
"revan_analysis_id. External primary data requires an explicit analysis_id."
msgstr ""
"构造读取元数据和主 cfg 字节，不创建目录或启动原生进程。working_space 是包含 manifest.json 及同级 cosima/revan/mimrec "
"的实验根，不能传分析或产物子目录。analysis_id 标识 Mimrec 组，可与上游 Revan 名不同；省略时等于 revan_analysis_id。外部主数据必须显式指定 "
"analysis_id。"

msgid ""
"The primary input is resolved to a concrete execution and TRA product. If the Revan group has "
"several successful executions, construct with an exact ``input_data=reconstructed`` "
"result/reference instead of relying on its name. A later Revan execution does not change the "
"primary input already bound to an object. References preserve upstream identities; raw TRA paths "
"use size/mtime metadata without event scanning or copying."
msgstr ""
"主输入解析为具体执行及 TRA 产物。Revan 组有多个成功执行时，应以 ``input_data=reconstructed`` 精确传结果/引用，不能仅依赖组名。对象绑定后，后续 "
"Revan 执行不会改变它的主输入。结果引用保留上游身份；裸 TRA 路径仅记录大小和 mtime，不扫描事件或复制数据。"

msgid ""
"A new external-root records its real external_tra origin. Additional external steps and "
"components preserve any existing Cosima/SIM/TRA primary origin."
msgstr "新建外部输入根会记录真实 external_tra origin。额外外部步骤与成分不会替换已有 Cosima/SIM/TRA 主 origin。"

msgid "How subsequent operations find extracted data"
msgstr "后续操作如何定位提取数据"

msgid ""
"**task=\"event-selected\" is not a fixed phrase or a lookup convention.** task is only an output "
"directory label. The preceding example deliberately uses ``task=\"energy-cut\"``; spectrum() "
"still finds the extracted data correctly."
msgstr ""
"**task=\"event-selected\" 不是固定短语或查找约定。** task 只是输出目录标签。上例故意使用 ``task=\"energy-cut\"``，spectrum() "
"仍可正确定位提取结果。"

msgid "For image/spectrum/arm, when input_data is omitted the bound analysis queries the root manifest:"
msgstr "image/spectrum/arm 省略 input_data 时，绑定分析按根 manifest 查询："

msgid "Restrict records to this Mimrec analysis group."
msgstr "将候选限制在当前 Mimrec 分析组。"

msgid ""
"Find successful records with ``operation=\"extract_events\"``. Use the result only if there is "
"exactly one."
msgstr "查找成功且 ``operation=\"extract_events\"`` 的记录，只有恰好一条时才能使用。"

msgid ""
"If no successful extraction exists, use the group's unique successful "
"``operation=\"add_external_components\"`` result, if present."
msgstr "没有成功提取时，如存在唯一成功的 ``operation=\"add_external_components\"``，使用该结果。"

msgid ""
"Otherwise use the registered primary input. If external components were declared but no "
"successful extraction/materialization exists, call ``extract_events()`` first; components are "
"never silently ignored."
msgstr "否则使用已登记主输入。如果声明了外部成分但尚未成功提取或物化，请先调用 ``extract_events()``；不会静默忽略成分。"

msgid ""
"The selected execution UUID and its recorded TRA path become the next command's upstream. The "
"reader does not search for an event-selected folder, inspect filenames/mtime or choose the latest"
" result. Failed executions are excluded."
msgstr "选定 execution UUID 与记录中的 TRA 路径成为下游上游引用。不搜索 event-selected 文件夹、不按文件名/mtime 或“最新”选择。失败记录不参与候选。"

msgid ""
"**Multiple successful extractions are ambiguous**, even when their task labels are different. "
"Multiple combinations are likewise ambiguous when there is no unique extraction. Select an exact "
"result/reference:"
msgstr "**多个成功提取即有歧义**，即使 task 标签不同。没有唯一提取时，多个成功组合也有歧义。应明确传入结果或引用："

msgid ""
"With declared external_components, extract_events() without input_data always starts from the "
"primary plus all declared components, using one IN/END list and one native -x. Repeated calls "
"make independent selections of this same dataset; they do not re-add components to an earlier "
"extraction. To further filter an existing result, pass input_data=selected explicitly; only that "
"TRA is read. Without external components, repeated implicit extraction retains the existing "
"manifest selection order and can further filter a prior extraction. For independent cuts in that "
"case, explicitly pass the same primary to each call. A later looser cut cannot recover events "
"already removed from its selected input."
msgstr ""
"声明 external_components 后，extract_events() 省略 input_data 时始终从主数据及全部声明成分出发，使用一个 IN/END 列表和一次原生 "
"-x。重复调用对同一声明数据独立筛选，不向旧提取结果重复加成分。进一步筛选已有结果时显式传 input_data=selected，仅读取该 TRA。没有外部成分时，隐式重复提取沿用 "
"manifest 选择顺序，可能继续筛选已有结果；要做独立 cut，应每次显式传相同 primary。后续更宽松的 cut 无法恢复输入中已删除的事件。"

msgid ""
"If cut-a itself was executed several times, select/save the exact execution reference rather than"
" guessing. task and operation are distinct manifest fields: operation comes from the Python "
"method; task is chosen by the caller."
msgstr ""
"cut-a 本身重复成功执行时，也需保存/选择精确 execution 引用。task 与 operation 是不同 manifest 字段：operation 来自 Python "
"方法，task 由调用者命名。"

msgid ""
"Mimrec.spectrum no longer accepts a working_space argument or positional input. Bind the "
"experiment root in Mimrec(..., working_space=...), and use spectrum(input_data=selected) only "
"when selecting an exact TRA result. The removed keyword raises TypeError; it is never forwarded "
"as a native -C."
msgstr ""
"Mimrec.spectrum 不再接受 working_space 或位置输入。在 Mimrec(..., working_space=...) 绑定实验根；仅当要精确指定 TRA 时使用 "
"spectrum(input_data=selected)。已移除的关键字会抛出 TypeError，绝不转发为原生 -C。"

msgid ""
"A bound command's explicit input_data must be the declared primary input or a TRA result in this "
"analysis's own data chain; it cannot silently replace the dataset with an unrelated result. Other"
" operations retain their legacy working_space entry for compatibility; new code should use the "
"constructor binding and input_data consistently."
msgstr ""
"绑定分析的显式 input_data 必须是声明主输入，或该分析自身数据链中的 TRA 结果，不能静默换成无关数据。其他操作为兼容保留旧 working_space "
"入口；新代码应统一使用构造绑定与 input_data。"

msgid "Baseline configuration versus command overrides"
msgstr "基准配置与单次命令覆盖"

msgid ""
"The constructor's config_file, geometry and ``**configuration`` establish the baseline. Native "
"cfg bytes remain opaque: Python does not parse XML, repair tags, rewrite resource paths, discover"
" geometry resources or edit settings. The original configuration directory remains native cwd for"
" relative resources. The original main cfg can be removed after construction/recording; its bytes"
" are retained in the analysis definition and execution manifests."
msgstr ""
"构造中的 config_file、geometry 和 ``**configuration`` 定义基准。原生 cfg 字节保持 opaque：Python 不解析 "
"XML、不修标签、不重写资源路径、不发现 geometry 或编辑设置。相对资源仍以原配置目录为 cwd。构造/记录后原主 cfg 可删除，其字节保存在分析定义和执行 manifest 中。"

msgid "Each method's keyword overrides apply **only to that execution**:"
msgstr "方法关键字覆盖 **只影响本次执行**："

msgid ""
"The extraction receives -C TotalEnergy.Min=100. Spectrum returns to the baseline -C "
"TotalEnergy.Min=50 and consumes the already-filtered TRA. It inherits the derived data, not the "
"previous command's overrides. Later native selections still apply to that data. Method overrides "
"never become group defaults, even when they appear in the first command executed in a new group."
msgstr ""
"提取收到 -C TotalEnergy.Min=100；Spectrum 回到基准 -C TotalEnergy.Min=50，并消费已筛选的 "
"TRA。它接续衍生数据，而不继承前一命令的覆盖。后续原生筛选仍作用于该数据。即使首次执行使用临时覆盖，也不会将其作为组默认。"

msgid ""
"The manifest separately records analysis baseline overrides, execution_overrides and the "
"effective configuration_overrides passed to native MEGAlib. Only key underscores become dots; "
"booleans become true/false; other values use str, with spaces, underscores, equals signs and "
"environment expressions left intact. No time, flux, intensity or exposure scaling is performed."
msgstr ""
"manifest 分别记录分析基准覆盖、execution_overrides 和实际传给 MEGAlib 的 configuration_overrides。只有键名下划线转点；布尔值转 "
"true/false，其他使用 str，保留空格、下划线、等号与环境表达式。不做时间、流量、强度或曝光缩放。"

msgid ""
"Reopening the same analysis_id restores and checks the recorded definition. Different primary "
"data, external components, main cfg bytes/resource cwd, baseline geometry or baseline overrides "
"require a new analysis_id. Main cfg and geometry can be omitted on method calls; explicit "
"conflicting replacements are rejected. No semantic configuration-equivalence parser is "
"introduced."
msgstr ""
"重开同一 analysis_id 会恢复并检查已记录定义。不同主数据、外部成分、主 cfg 字节/资源 cwd、基准 geometry 或覆盖要求新 analysis_id。方法可省略主 cfg"
" 与 geometry；显式冲突替换会被拒绝。不解析配置语义等价性。"

msgid "Prepared external components and native combination"
msgstr "准备好的外部成分与原生组合"

msgid ""
"Declare external_components when defining the analysis, then call extract_events() directly. "
"Components can be background, another GRB or any prepared TRA; no physical classification is "
"inferred. One native command reads the complete declared dataset and applies the extraction "
"settings. There is no required add_external_components() call or intermediate combined TRA."
msgstr ""
"定义分析时声明 external_components，然后直接调用 extract_events()。成分可以是背景、其他 GRB 或任意准备好的 "
"TRA，不推断物理类别。一次原生命令读取全部声明数据并应用筛选，无需先调用 add_external_components() 或产生中间 combined TRA。"

msgid ""
"The numeric time range is illustrative; supply one valid for your data's native time system. The "
"wrapper does not infer valid background intervals. extract_events writes an IN/END list with "
"absolute primary/component paths and runs native mimrec -x once, following the official "
"`MFileEvents include reader "
"<https://github.com/zoglauer/megalib/blob/11b797167eecb88ae84b63a852edf5a466d964ae/src/global/misc/src/MFileEvents.cxx#L676>`_."
" Main input and components are not copied or parsed. Result/reference components retain every "
"real upstream UUID, including selected records from another workspace; raw external paths are "
"recorded with stat-only metadata. The primary workspace origin remains intact. The list's content"
" is stored in the manifest, and its native file is temporary unless archive_inputs is explicitly "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"时间范围仅为示例，请提供原生时间系统中的有效区间。本包不推断有效背景窗口。extract_events 写入主输入和成分绝对路径的 IN/END 列表，按官方 `MFileEvents "
"include reader "
"<https://github.com/zoglauer/megalib/blob/11b797167eecb88ae84b63a852edf5a466d964ae/src/global/misc/src/MFileEvents.cxx#L676>`_"
" 运行一次 mimrec -x。不复制或解析输入。结果/引用保留全部真实上游 UUID，包括跨 workspace 的选定记录；裸路径仅 stat。主 origin 不变。列表内容存于 "
"manifest，其实体文件默认临时，除非显式启用 archive_inputs。"

msgid ""
"**The single extraction applies its cfg selections to all declared inputs.** Choose main settings"
" and extraction overrides appropriate for all components. Background preparation overrides are "
"not carried forward automatically. No clock alignment, exposure normalization or event-intensity "
"scaling is added. Do not assume that background and source event clocks have been aligned."
msgstr "**一次提取会将 cfg 筛选应用于所有声明输入。** 主配置与方法覆盖须适用于全部成分。背景准备的覆盖不会自动继承，不增加时钟对齐、曝光归一化或事件强度缩放。不要假设背景与源的时钟已经对齐。"

msgid ""
"Repeated default extract_events() calls start from the full declared input set, even if earlier "
"extractions exist. An explicit input_data=selected instead re-filters that result alone; no "
"component is appended a second time. The extraction record itself contains every parent, "
"component_inputs and include_list. Later image/spectrum calls receive its exact result, or query "
"the unique successful extraction under the normal manifest selection rules."
msgstr ""
"默认重复 extract_events() 始终从完整声明集开始，不依赖此前提取。显式 input_data=selected "
"则只重筛该结果，不再次添加成分。提取记录包含全部父节点、component_inputs 和 include_list。后续 image/spectrum 显式接收结果，或按正常 "
"manifest 规则选择唯一成功提取。"

msgid ""
"add_external_components() remains available as an optional explicit native materialization "
"operation. It is not part of the recommended flow. If deliberately using it before a second "
"extraction, pass input_data=combined explicitly to consume that materialized TRA. Both commands "
"apply their own native selections."
msgstr ""
"add_external_components() 仍是可选的显式原生物化接口，不属于推荐必经流程。如确实先物化再提取，应显式传 input_data=combined 消费其 "
"TRA；两次命令各自应用原生筛选。"

msgid "A small ordinary-function workflow is available for already prepared components:"
msgstr "对于已准备好的成分，可使用一个普通函数组合流程："

msgid ""
"It performs one extraction over the declared dataset, then images and calculates a spectrum. Each"
" analysis receives the exact extraction result, so repeated workflow calls do not rely on "
"implicit latest selections. Separate override dictionaries are available for the three "
"operations. There is no combination_overrides argument or separate combined result. Earlier "
"successful results remain if a later step fails. Random background-window selection, multi-trial "
"studies and scheduling remain future work; each independent Cosima trial must use a separate "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"该函数对声明数据提取一次，再成像、计算谱。下游均接收精确提取结果，重复运行不依赖隐式“最新”选择。三个操作分别接收覆盖字典，没有 combination_overrides 参数或独立 "
"combined 结果。后续失败时保留先前成功产物。包内随机背景窗口、多 trial study 与调度仍属后续扩展；每个独立 Cosima trial 必须使用独立 workspace。"

msgid "Outputs, failures and compatibility"
msgstr "输出、失败与兼容性"

msgid ""
"Native operations are extract_events (-x), image (-i), spectrum (-s), arm (-a) and "
"add_external_components (-x on an include list). TRA operations return the tra product group; "
"plots return image/spectrum/arm. Defaults remain native ROOT products for numerical analysis. A "
"requested PNG does not also save ROOT."
msgstr ""
"原生操作为 extract_events (-x)、image (-i)、spectrum (-s)、arm (-a) 和 add_external_components（include "
"列表上的 -x）。TRA 操作返回 tra 产物组；绘图操作返回 image/spectrum/arm。默认保存可供数值分析的 ROOT。请求 PNG 不会同时保存 ROOT。"

msgid ""
"Outputs live under mimrec/<analysis_id>/<task>, with shared inputs/logs and one root manifest. "
"Every command has its own UUID, upstream references and status. Requested filenames are preserved"
" unless occupied/reserved; conflicts gain -002, -003, etc. without overwriting historical "
"products. Empty logs are removed. ExecutionError retains manifest_path and execution_id for "
"failures. Native exit zero plus a nonempty expected product is execution validation only."
msgstr ""
"输出位于 mimrec/<analysis_id>/<task>，共享 inputs/logs 和一个根 manifest。每条命令有独立 "
"UUID、上游与状态。文件名未占用/预留时保持原名，冲突添加 -002、-003 等，不覆盖历史。删除空日志；失败时 ExecutionError 保留 manifest_path 和 "
"execution_id。零退出加非空预期产物只代表执行验证。"

msgid ""
"Old schema-2 groups remain readable. Opening one with config_file in the constructor explicitly "
"binds its existing main data/defaults; different baseline settings require a new ID. New bound "
"definitions cannot be bypassed by consuming their results through a legacy tool object. "
"Schema-1/old directory layouts remain read-only; no files are moved or migrated."
msgstr ""
"旧 schema-2 组仍可读。在构造中传 config_file 重开时，显式绑定原有主数据/defaults；基准变化要求新 "
"ID。旧工具对象消费结果也不能绕过已有绑定。schema-1/旧目录布局只读，不移动或迁移文件。"

msgid ""
"Unbound legacy operations still support their prior per-command configuration and variant-warning"
" behavior, except spectrum's removed working_space argument. Migrate spectrum(result, ...) to "
"spectrum(input_data=result, ...), and move root selection into the constructor. The full-chain "
"example uses the new bound API. See :doc:`workspaces` and :doc:`api/index` for details."
msgstr ""
"未绑定旧操作保留每命令配置及变体警告行为，但 spectrum 已删除 working_space。将 spectrum(result, ...) 改为 "
"spectrum(input_data=result, ...)，并将根目录选择移到构造函数。完整链示例使用新接口。详见 :doc:`workspaces` 和 "
":doc:`api/index`。"

msgid "ROOT data and rendered plots"
msgstr "ROOT 数据与渲染图像"

msgid ""
"For numerical spectrum or localization analysis, retain ``spectrum.root`` and ``image.root`` (the"
" method defaults). The full-chain smoke example defaults to these ROOT products. Passing "
"``output_name=\"spectrum.png\"`` or ``output_name=\"image.png\"`` asks native Mimrec to save a "
"rendered image instead; it does not also save a ROOT file. PNG pixels do not preserve the "
"histogram bins and metadata required for numerical analysis."
msgstr ""
"数值谱和定位分析应保留默认 ``spectrum.root`` 与 ``image.root``。完整链 smoke "
"示例默认如此。``output_name=\"spectrum.png\"`` 或 ``output_name=\"image.png\"`` 只请求原生渲染图片，不额外保存 ROOT。PNG "
"像素不保留分析所需的直方图 bins 和元数据。"

msgid ""
"To recover ROOT products after a PNG-only run, reuse the exact successful extraction result and "
"the saved configuration; Cosima and Revan need not run again. These are new Mimrec executions, "
"not a conversion of the PNG:"
msgstr "仅保存 PNG 后，使用相同成功提取结果和保存的配置重新生成 ROOT 即可，无需重跑 Cosima/Revan。这是新的 Mimrec 执行，不是从 PNG 转换："

msgid ""
"The files remain in the same Mimrec analysis group and the manifest records each new execution. "
"Existing PNG products remain available."
msgstr "文件仍位于同一 Mimrec 分析组；manifest 记录每次新执行，已有 PNG 保留。"

msgid "Extract numerical ROOT results"
msgstr "提取 ROOT 数值结果"

msgid ""
"``extract_spectrum`` and ``extract_image`` accept either a returned ``ExecutionResult`` or a ROOT"
" filename. They return NumPy arrays and metadata in memory, without creating CSV, TSV, PNG or "
"persistent cache files. They do not modify the input file, workspace or manifest, and do not "
"rerun Mimrec."
msgstr ""
"``extract_spectrum`` 和 ``extract_image`` 接受 ``ExecutionResult`` 或 ROOT 文件路径。默认返回内存中的 NumPy "
"数组与元数据，不生成 CSV、TSV、PNG 或持久缓存。不修改输入、workspace 或 manifest，也不重跑 Mimrec。"

msgid ""
"PyROOT is loaded **only in a separate subprocess**. Keep the analysis environment (for example "
"Python 3.12) separate from the MEGAlib/ROOT environment (for example Python 3.10). The child runs"
" a standalone bundled reader using only the standard library and PyROOT; it does not require "
"megalibpy or its analysis dependencies. Do not add the other environment's PyROOT site-packages "
"to the analysis Python. uproot alone cannot read the Canvas contents of the verified Mimrec "
"samples."
msgstr ""
"PyROOT **仅在独立子进程加载**。分析环境（例如 Python 3.12）与 MEGAlib/ROOT（例如 Python 3.10）应分离。子进程运行内置独立读取器，只需标准库和 "
"PyROOT，无需安装 megalibpy 及分析依赖。不要将另一个环境的 PyROOT site-packages 加入分析 Python。uproot 单独无法读取已验证样本中的 "
"Canvas 内容。"

msgid "For a setup script that activates MEGAlib and its ROOT-compatible Python:"
msgstr "setup 脚本能激活 MEGAlib 及兼容 ROOT 的 Python 时："

msgid ""
"By default setup mode resolves ``python`` after sourcing the script. If the script does not "
"activate the matching Python, supply ``root_python=\"/path/to/root-environment/bin/python\"`` as "
"well. Direct mode defaults to the calling Python executable, still in a child process; use "
"``root_python`` to select a different ROOT-compatible interpreter. The child requires Python "
">=3.10. Each call has a 120-second timeout by default; pass ``timeout=None`` to disable it. "
"Native/setup diagnostics are isolated from the structured response. All temporary transport files"
" are removed after the call."
msgstr ""
"setup 模式默认在 source 后解析 ``python``。脚本未激活匹配 Python 时，另传 ``root_python=\"/path/to/root-"
"environment/bin/python\"``。direct 默认用调用者 Python，但仍在子进程运行；也可用 root_python 指定不同的 ROOT 兼容解释器。子进程要求 "
"Python >=3.10。每次默认超时 120 秒，``timeout=None`` 取消限制。原生/setup 诊断与结构化响应隔离，调用结束删除所有临时传输文件。"

msgid "Spectrum units and counts"
msgstr "谱的单位与计数"

msgid ""
"``spectrum.axis.edges`` has N+1 energy edges; ``axis.widths`` and ``axis.centers`` are derived "
"without assuming uniform or logarithmic bins. ``values`` contains the original N regular-bin "
"contents. ROOT titles are retained verbatim; bracketed units are preserved, and absent units "
"remain unknown."
msgstr ""
"``spectrum.axis.edges`` 包含 N+1 个能量边界；``axis.widths`` 和 ``axis.centers`` 不假设等宽或对数分箱。``values`` 是 N"
" 个常规 bin 的原始内容。原样保留 ROOT 标题与方括号单位，缺失单位保持未知。"

msgid "For the native ``counts / keV`` spectrum with ``Energy [keV]``, total counts is:"
msgstr "对于 X 轴为 ``Energy [keV]`` 的原生 ``counts / keV`` 谱，总计数为："

#, python-brace-format
msgid "N = \\sum_i h_i (E_{i+1} - E_i)."
msgstr "N = \\sum_i h_i (E_{i+1} - E_i)."

msgid ""
"``total_counts`` applies this only to recognized exact count-density labels (``counts/keV``, "
"``count/keV``, ``cts/keV``, ignoring whitespace/case), with a ``keV`` X unit. Exact count labels "
"(``counts``, ``count``, ``cts``) are summed without multiplying by widths. Unknown labels, rates,"
" normalized histograms, or inconsistent energy units raise ``ValueError`` when total_counts is "
"requested. They remain extractable without silently assigning a count interpretation. This relies"
" on the histogram's labels: mislabeled data cannot be validated by this reader. No exposure or "
"flux scaling is performed. Underflow/overflow contents are returned separately in ``flow_values``"
" and excluded from counts."
msgstr ""
"``total_counts`` 仅在 X 单位为 ``keV`` "
"且标签精确匹配计数密度（``counts/keV``、``count/keV``、``cts/keV``，忽略大小写和空白）时按宽度积分。精确计数标签 "
"``counts``、``count``、``cts`` 直接求和，不乘宽度。未知标签、rate、归一化谱或能量单位不一致时，访问 total_counts 抛出 "
"``ValueError``，但仍可读取原始数据。解释依赖标签，读取器不能验证标错标签的数据。不做曝光或流量缩放。underflow/overflow 单独放在 "
"``flow_values``，不计入总数。"

msgid "Image coordinates and peak definition"
msgstr "图像坐标与峰位置定义"

msgid ""
"``image.values`` has shape ``(Nx, Ny)`` and uses ``values[ix, iy]``. The X/Y edges retain native "
"histogram coordinates. ``peak_position`` is the arithmetic center of the unique maximum finite "
"pixel; it is **not a centroid**, a fitted position or a sub-pixel estimate. NaN/Inf pixels are "
"excluded from peak selection. Tied maxima or an image without finite pixels raise ``ValueError`` "
"on peak access."
msgstr ""
"``image.values`` 形状为 ``(Nx, Ny)``，按 ``values[ix, iy]`` 索引。X/Y 边界保留原生坐标。``peak_position`` "
"是唯一有限最大像素的算术中心，**不是 centroid**、拟合位置或亚像素估计。选择峰时排除 NaN/Inf；最大值并列或无有限像素时，访问峰属性抛出 ``ValueError``。"

msgid "For plotting the unmodified native grid, the caller can explicitly use:"
msgstr "如需绘制未经变换的原生网格，可显式使用："

msgid ""
"The verified rectangular Galactic Mimrec image stores reversed pixel contents and a separate "
"``TGaxis`` for longitude. The reader inspects this axis's actual endpoints and label range to "
"recover an affine mapping, rather than copying the old sign-change rule. "
"``peak_galactic_position`` applies that mapping and wraps longitude to [0, 360). It returns a "
"scalar Astropy SkyCoord with the Galactic frame, supporting nonzero longitude offsets. Use "
"position.l.deg and position.b.deg for numeric degrees, or position.separation(true_position) to "
"calculate a spherical angular error. The histogram bins remain unchanged. This replaces the "
"previous tuple return; migrate longitude, latitude = position to longitude, latitude = "
"position.l.deg, position.b.deg."
msgstr ""
"已验证的矩形银河图以反向像素内容和独立经度 ``TGaxis`` 存储。读取器检查真实端点及标签范围恢复仿射映射，不照搬旧经度变号规则。``peak_galactic_position`` "
"应用该映射并将经度 wrap 到 [0, 360)，返回标量 Galactic Astropy SkyCoord，支持非零经度偏置。通过 position.l.deg 和 "
"position.b.deg 读取角度，或 position.separation(true_position) 计算球面角距。直方图 bins 不变。此接口替代旧元组返回；将 "
"longitude, latitude = position 改为 longitude, latitude = position.l.deg, position.b.deg。"

msgid ""
"A Galactic Latitude [deg] Y axis and a unique, explicit, linear Galactic Longitude [deg] TGaxis "
"spanning the histogram are required for that mapping. Unrecognized, nonlinear and Hammer "
"projections stay ``unknown`` and return None for ``peak_galactic_position``. A SkyCoord is "
"constructed only after the Galactic mapping is verified; no unknown frame, equatorial "
"transformation or inverse Hammer projection is inferred. This behavior follows the official "
"`MImageGalactic implementation "
"<https://github.com/zoglauer/megalib/blob/11b797167eecb88ae84b63a852edf5a466d964ae/src/mimrec/src/MImageGalactic.cxx>`_."
" The native spectrum density normalization is implemented in `MInterfaceMimrec "
"<https://github.com/zoglauer/megalib/blob/11b797167eecb88ae84b63a852edf5a466d964ae/src/mimrec/src/MInterfaceMimrec.cxx>`_."
msgstr ""
"映射要求 Y 轴为 Galactic Latitude [deg]，且存在唯一、显式、线性、横跨直方图的 Galactic Longitude [deg] TGaxis。未知、非线性和 "
"Hammer 投影保持 ``unknown``，``peak_galactic_position`` 返回 None。仅验证映射后才构造 SkyCoord，不猜坐标系、不做赤道变换或 "
"Hammer 逆投影。依据官方 `MImageGalactic 实现 "
"<https://github.com/zoglauer/megalib/blob/11b797167eecb88ae84b63a852edf5a466d964ae/src/mimrec/src/MImageGalactic.cxx>`_；原生谱密度归一化见"
" `MInterfaceMimrec "
"<https://github.com/zoglauer/megalib/blob/11b797167eecb88ae84b63a852edf5a466d964ae/src/mimrec/src/MInterfaceMimrec.cxx>`_。"

msgid "Selecting ROOT objects explicitly"
msgstr "显式选择 ROOT 对象"

msgid ""
"The reader recursively visits TDirectory keys, Canvas and nested Pad primitives, identifies "
"TH1/TH2 by ROOT inheritance and dimension, and excludes profiles and TH3. It does not depend on "
"key order or fixed primitive indices. Every stored key cycle remains a candidate; multiple "
"matching histograms require explicit choice:"
msgstr ""
"读取器递归访问 TDirectory keys、Canvas 和嵌套 Pad primitives，按 ROOT 继承与维度识别 TH1/TH2，排除 profile 与 TH3。不依赖 key"
" 顺序或固定 primitive 索引。所有 key cycle 均为候选，多个匹配直方图必须显式选择："

msgid ""
"Selectors include directory key cycles and the Canvas/Pad hierarchy. Names are URL-escaped; "
"repeated primitive names have explicit occurrence suffixes. A result containing multiple ROOT "
"products also requires an explicit file path. Neither file modification times nor a latest-cycle "
"heuristic select data."
msgstr ""
"选择器包含目录 key cycle 与 Canvas/Pad 层级。名称使用 URL 转义；重复 primitive 名有出现次数后缀。一个执行包含多个 ROOT "
"产物时，也要显式传文件路径。不按 mtime 或最新 cycle 猜测数据。"

msgid "Verified scope"
msgstr "验证范围"

msgid ""
"The 2026-11-22 implementation was checked locally with a Python 3.12 caller and a separate Python"
" 3.10/ROOT reader against user-supplied native Mimrec Canvas spectrum and rectangular Galactic "
"image files. This validates bin extraction for those samples; it does not establish every MEGAlib"
" version/projection or scientific localization accuracy. Portable tests cover numerical "
"contracts; real ROOT integration tests generate synthetic files when ``MEGALIBPY_ROOT_PYTHON`` "
"identifies a ROOT-compatible executable. The normal CI environment does not install ROOT and "
"skips those optional integration tests."
msgstr ""
"2026-11-22 使用 Python 3.12 调用者与独立 Python 3.10/ROOT 读取器，验证了用户提供的 Mimrec Canvas 谱和矩形银河图样本。这验证这些样本的 "
"bin 读取，不代表覆盖所有 MEGAlib 版本、投影或科学定位精度。可移植测试验证数值契约；设置 ``MEGALIBPY_ROOT_PYTHON`` 指向兼容 ROOT 的 Python "
"后，真实 ROOT 集成测试会生成合成文件。常规 CI 不安装 ROOT，跳过可选集成测试。"

msgid ""
"The user subsequently verified both extraction APIs on Palmetto: spectrum ``total_counts`` agrees"
" with the event-extraction log, and the image ``peak_galactic_position`` lies close to the "
"injected source coordinates. This validates the tested spectrum and rectangular Galactic image "
"workflow; it does not establish a localization uncertainty or coverage of other projections."
msgstr ""
"用户随后在 Palmetto 验证两项接口：谱的 ``total_counts`` 与事件提取日志一致，图像 ``peak_galactic_position`` "
"接近注入源位置。这验证所测试的谱和矩形银河图流程，不代表得到定位不确定度或覆盖其他投影。"

msgid "Recovery after deleting a failed analysis"
msgstr "删除失败分析后的恢复"

msgid ""
"If a Mimrec group has only failed executions and its entire directory has been removed, "
"reconstructing it with the same analysis_id may use corrected main settings. The constructor "
"retains recorded primary/component references when omitted, while an explicit main cfg "
"establishes fresh configuration defaults. The next execution recreates the layout and records the"
" corrected definition; all previous failed execution records remain intact. Existing, successful "
"or in-progress groups cannot use this reset. See :doc:`workspaces` for the full recovery "
"contract, including deleted-output limitations and Cosima's separate single-execution rule."
msgstr ""
"Mimrec 组仅有失败执行且整个目录已被删除时，可用相同 analysis_id 和修正后的主设置重新构造。省略主输入/成分时恢复已记录引用；显式主 cfg "
"建立新基准。下次执行重建目录并登记修正定义，保留全部旧失败记录。目录仍在、有成功或在途记录的组不能这样重置。完整条件、已删除产物限制和 Cosima 单次规则见 "
":doc:`workspaces`。"
